  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_flower",
      "name": {
        "en": "Perfumer's Badge",
        "zh": "调香师证章",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "original",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Perfumer has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for healing several teammates in a short period of time. \nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution: \nThis operator shall be appointed a Medic Operator during field operations to exercise Multi-target Medic responsibilities. \nIn witness whereof, \nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员调香师擅长在短时间内为数位干员提供治疗\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为医疗干员，行使群愈师职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_flower",
      "name": {
        "en": "'Aegean's Kiss'",
        "zh": "“爱琴之吻”",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "Y",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_flower",
      "description": {
        "en": "Inhale–– \nLet the aroma linger in your nose for a spell–– \nSlowly exhale–– \nHow was that, Doctor? This perfume's pretty nice, right? \nHm, my secret? What secret? \nAll the ingredients are all-natural. You just have to put a liiit-tle extra work into it. \nYou still want to know more? \nMy, oh my, you're not planning on just copying the recipe, are you? \nHehe~ Well, it doesn't matter if I write the recipe down for you anyway. This can only be made with local materials from Minos. \nNot a single ingredient can be substituted. \nIt's like–– all my personal memories from Minos distilled. \nThe nights in the Aegean Plain, the peacefully grazing fowlbeasts, the moon settling into the bottom of the lake, springtime in boronia's blossom–– \nI can see it. \nI can feel it. \nThere's nothing quite like it. \nAlas–– 'nothing quite like it' isn't quite right. After all, everyone can enjoy this aroma. \nAhh, just treat this as using your nose to alleviate a little bit of my homesickness~ \nNow, tell me, Doctor. \nWhat can you smell, \nfrom this 'Aegean's Kiss'~~",
        "zh": "吸气——\n让香味在鼻子里停留一会——\n慢慢呼出来——\n怎么样博士，这款香水不错吧。\n唉，秘密？什么秘密？\n只是原料有些多，工艺稍微复杂一点——点罢了。\n您想要更多地了解一下？\n哎呀哎呀，不会是想拿了配方去复制吧。\n哼哼~就算写给您也无妨哦，反正这个东西，只能用米诺斯当地的材料做。\n没有一样能够被替代。\n就像——我个人对米诺斯的浓缩回忆。\n爱琴平原的夜晚，缓掠的羽兽，沉入湖底的月亮，波罗尼色的春天——\n看得见。\n摸得着。\n独一无二。\n啊——独一无二好像也不太准确，毕竟大家都嗅到了。\n唉，就当是借各位的鼻子舒缓一下我的乡愁吧~\n现在，告诉我吧，博士。\n你从这“爱琴之吻”里，\n闻出了什么呢~~",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ],
